SUMMARY:Windborne Presents Music of Midwinter
LOCATION:Arts at the Armory\, 191 Highland Ave\, Somerville\, MA 02143
DESCRIPTION:A joyful and heartfelt celebration of song\, Windborne’s lush
  vocals and unique arrangements bring light to a dark time\, drawing on mi
 dwinter music from traditional\, classical\, and folk roots in the US\, Br
 itish Isles and beyond. Unique from their typical show\, the holiday spiri
 t is accentuated with added instrumentation\, including banjos and guitars
 \, Lithuanian Kanklės\, and Irish bodhrán.\nhttps://artsatthearmory.org/
 events/windborne-presents-music-of-midwinter/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:
 //pushpin.city/
URL:https://artsatthearmory.org/events/windborne-presents-music-of-midwinte
 r/
END:VEVENT
